Package: aegis-welcome
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3,
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         pkexec,
         aegis-firewall (>= 1.2.0)
Recommends: aegis-control
Description: Aegis OS first-boot welcome wizard (GTK)
 A friendly setup assistant shown on first login: it explains what Aegis is,
 lets the user choose a network mode (Tor / I2P / Both / Direct) and MAC-spoofing
 in plain language, applies those choices, and offers to install Aegis to disk.
 It runs once and then leaves a marker so it never reappears.
